										},
										"bodyText": "issue (blocking): This waits on the vblank a whole period before the frame is due. On the 144 Hz rig with a 60 Hz target that is two refreshes early, so begin_frame returns before the previous frame has been shown.",
										"id": "PRRC_promo_wait_1",
										"line": 36,
										"originalLine": 36,
										"outdated": false,
										"path": "src/render/frame_pacer.cpp",
